    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Infused Items",
      "category": "interaction",
      "text": "Ingnovim carries\n\n4 Acid Flask (Major)\n\n4 Alchemist's Fire (Major)\n\n2 Bestial Mutagen (Major)\n\n4 Bottled Lightning (Major)\n\n4 Frost Vial (Major)\n\n2 Juggernaut Mutagen (Major)\n\n4 Elixir of Life (True)\n\nThese items last for 24 hours or until the next time he makes his daily preparations."
